hypotheses.statement:
Let $D$ be a nonzero unital separable complex $C^*$-algebra without characters, and write $$B=D^{\otimes_{\min}\infty}
 :=\varinjlim_{n\ge1}
 \bigl(D^{\otimes_{\min}n},\,x\longmapsto x\otimes1_D\bigr).$$ Then $B\cong B\otimes_{\min}\mathcal Z$, and $B$ contains a unital copy of $\mathcal Z$.

